window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Elysium Awaits:</p> <p>Hades is the stoic leader of her domain, not only being queen of the shadows, but of an exclusive club known as Elysium, where one’s heart’s desires are served up on a platter. She enjoys her solitary existence, that is until a new hire shows up at her doorstep, one that she can’t get out of her head. In order to keep her, she’ll have to defy the city, or lose everything trying.</p> <p>Persephone used to be Hesiod Square’s best kept secret, but that time is done. In an attempt to thwart her mother and find out who she really is, she finds the only person who ever showed her she could be more than a captured princess. She wants Hades, even if she can't admit it. And Persephone’s willing to take on anything, including her mother, to get her woman back.</p> <p>Iron Flight:</p> <p>Robin is stuck in her day to day, her future unknown. Until a Norse Goddess falls through her roof. Freya convinces Robin to help her navigate Midgard to find a way to rescue the goddess idun, before the rest of the Norse pantheon expires. Robin is thrust into an adventure like no other, and may just find herself along the way.</p>"; 
